OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely cloudy, though there
OL,6,Fwill be the odd break to brighter
OL,7,Fskies for some. A chance of showers in
OL,8,Fthe far southwest. Feeling cool,
OL,9,Fespecially along the breezy south
OL,10,Fcoast, with temperatures slightly
OL,11,Fbelow the seasonal average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy, and patches
OL,14,Fof light rain will push up from the
OL,15,Fsouth during the evening. The odd
OL,16,Fshower, overnight. Feeling chilly,
OL,17,Fthough winds will ease slightly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
