OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy, with patches of rain
OL,6,Fand showers mainly during the morning
OL,7,Fand focused around the southwest. Less
OL,8,Fwindy than during previous days, but
OL,9,Fstill feeling chilly.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FVariable cloud and fog patches at
OL,13,Ffirst on Saturday, with isolated
OL,14,Fshowers. Becoming increasingly clear
OL,15,Fand dry through to Monday with
OL,16,Fpleasant sunshine, and colder nights
OL,17,Fbringing frost and fog.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
